### ============================================
### HTC Manila Backend — API Tests
### ============================================

### Environment variables (change to your IP/port)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@locCode = EU|RU|MOW|Moscow
@lat = 55.7558
@lon = 37.6173

### ============================================
### 1. V1 — Legacy Format (HTC Manila Classic)
### ============================================

### 1.1. Get forecast by locCode (V1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/forecast-data_v3.asp?locCode={{locCode}}
Accept: application/xml

### 1.2. Get forecast by locCode with extra parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/forecast-data_v3.asp?locCode={{locCode}}&metric=celsius
Accept: application/xml

### 1.3. Get forecast by locCode with full query params
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/forecast-data_v3.asp?locCode={{locCode}}&metric=fahrenheit&lang=en
Accept: application/xml

### ============================================
### 2. V3 — New Format (AccuWeather V3)
### ============================================

### 2.1. Get forecast by locCode (V3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp?locCode={{locCode}}
Accept: application/xml

### 2.2. Get forecast by locCode with metric (celsius)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp?locCode={{locCode}}&metric=celsius
Accept: application/xml

### 2.3. Get forecast by locCode with metric (fahrenheit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp?locCode={{locCode}}&metric=fahrenheit
Accept: application/xml

### 2.4. Get forecast by locCode with extra params
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp?locCode={{locCode}}&metric=celsius&lang=en
Accept: application/xml

### ============================================
### 3. Reverse Geocoding (city lookup by coordinates)
### ============================================

### 3.1. Find city by coordinates
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/lat-lon-search.asp?lat={{lat}}&lon={{lon}}
Accept: application/xml

### 3.2. Find city by coordinates with extra params
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/lat-lon-search.asp?lat={{lat}}&lon={{lon}}&lang=en
Accept: application/xml

### 3.3. Find city by coordinates (missing lat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/lat-lon-search.asp?lon={{lon}}
Accept: application/xml

### 3.4. Find city by coordinates (missing lon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/lat-lon-search.asp?lat={{lat}}
Accept: application/xml

### 3.5. Find city by coordinates (invalid values)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/lat-lon-search.asp?lat=999.999&lon=999.999
Accept: application/xml

### ============================================
### 4. Fallback (Sniff) — everything else
### ============================================

### 4.1. Unknown path
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown
Accept: text/plain

### 4.2. Root path
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/plain

### 4.3. Unknown path with query params
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown?param1=value1&param2=value2
Accept: text/plain

### 4.4. POST request to unknown path
POST {{baseUrl}}/unknown
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test": "data"
}

### ============================================
### 5. Test Endpoints (for debugging)
### ============================================

### 5.1. Test V1 (if enabled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/test-htc-v1
Accept: application/xml

### 5.2. Test V3 (if enabled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/test-htc-v3
Accept: application/xml

### 5.3. Health check (if enabled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### 6. Various Scenarios for V1
### ============================================

### 6.1. Get forecast by locCode with URL encoding
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/forecast-data_v3.asp?locCode=EU%7CRU%7CMOW%7CMoscow
Accept: application/xml

### 6.2. Get forecast by locCode for another city
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/forecast-data_v3.asp?locCode=EU%7CFR%7CPAR%7CParis
Accept: application/xml

### ============================================
### 7. Various Scenarios for V3
### ============================================

### 7.1. Get forecast by locCode for another city
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp?locCode=EU%7CFR%7CPAR%7CParis
Accept: application/xml

### 7.2. Get forecast by locCode with metric for another city
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp?locCode=EU%7CGB%7CLON%7CLondon&metric=celsius
Accept: application/xml

### ============================================
### 8. Edge Cases
### ============================================

### 8.1. Empty locCode (V1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/forecast-data_v3.asp?locCode=
Accept: application/xml

### 8.2. Empty locCode (V3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp?locCode=
Accept: application/xml

### 8.3. Missing locCode (V1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc/forecast-data_v3.asp
Accept: application/xml

### 8.4. Missing locCode (V3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/widget/htc2/weather-data.asp
Accept: application/xml